,{"user":"anonymous","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1752109971938_272483519","id":"paragraph_1752109971938_272483519","dateCreated":"2025-07-10T01:12:51+0000","status":"FINISHED","text":"%md\r\n# registro de lluvias  anuales\r\nse puede ver que el ano en el que se registró mayor cantidad de lluvias fue el 2014 mientras que el \r\naño 2005 no se registraron lluvias mientras que el 2006 se registraron menos lluvias en comparación a los otros anos\r\n","focus":false,"dateUpdated":"2025-07-10T01:17:37+0000","dateFinished":"2025-07-10T01:17:37+0000","dateStarted":"2025-07-10T01:17:37+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>registro de lluvias  anuales</h1>\n<p>se puede ver que el ano en el que se registró mayor cantidad de lluvias fue el 2014 mientras que el<br />\naño 2005 no se registraron lluvias mientras que el 2006 se registraron menos lluvias en comparación a los otros anos</p>\n\n</div>"}]}},{"user":"anonymous","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{"0":{"graph":{"mode":"multiBarChart","height":300,"optionOpen":false,"setting":{"multiBarChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","stacked":false}},"keys":[{"name":"anio","index":0,"aggr":"sum"}],"groups":[],"values":[{"name":"count","index":1,"aggr":"sum"}]}}},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://10.0.5.2:4040/jobs/job?id=113"},{"jobUrl":"http://10.0.5.2:4040/jobs/job?id=114"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1752109467202_1473614591","id":"paragraph_1752109467202_1473614591","dateCreated":"2025-07-10T01:04:27+0000","status":"FINISHED","text":"import org.apache.spark.sql.functions._\r\n\r\n// Paso 1: Convertir Formatted Date a timestamp y extraer el año\r\nval dfConAnio = dfweatherHistory\r\n  .withColumn(\"fecha_ts\", to_timestamp(col(\"Formatted Date\")))\r\n  .withColumn(\"anio\", year(col(\"fecha_ts\")))\r\n\r\n// Paso 2: Filtrar solo registros donde Precip Type sea 'rain'\r\nval dfLluvia = dfConAnio.filter(lower(col(\"Precip Type\")) === \"rain\")\r\n\r\n// Paso 3: Agrupar por año y contar cuántos registros de lluvia hay por año\r\nval lluviaPorAnio = dfLluvia\r\n  .groupBy(\"anio\")\r\n  .count()\r\n  .orderBy(\"anio\")  // ← orden cronológico: menor a mayor año\r\n\r\n// Paso 4: Mostrar resultados en Zeppelin\r\nz.show(lluviaPorAnio)\r\n","focus":false,"dateUpdated":"2025-07-10T01:12:43+0000","dateFinished":"2025-07-10T01:12:43+0000","dateStarted":"2025-07-10T01:12:43+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TABLE","data":"anio\tcount\n2005\t1\n2006\t7468\n2007\t8015\n2008\t7985\n2009\t7742\n2010\t7454\n2011\t7362\n2012\t7342\n2013\t7735\n2014\t8272\n2015\t8132\n2016\t7716\n"},{"type":"TEXT","data":"import org.apache.spark.sql.functions._\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mdfConAnio\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [Formatted Date: timestamp, Summary: string ... 12 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mdfLluvia\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Dataset[org.apache.spark.sql.Row]\u001b[0m = [Formatted Date: timestamp, Summary: string ... 12 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mlluviaPorAnio\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Dataset[org.apache.spark.sql.Row]\u001b[0m = [anio: int, count: bigint]\n"}]}},{"user":"anonymous","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"edit